      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If you just work hard and be patient,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 215,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "you will soon receive the job you desire as well."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "It takes patience, but this is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "good life kekkeke"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Hmm, I would like to help you out . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : ". . . . . I'm not sure why you are looking"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "at me like that. I assure you that this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "might seem a little weird at first, but"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "what I tell you will most likely be a great aid to you.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Ha ha... It looks like you are getting"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "a bit interested in what I have to say."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I can teach you a very useful skill!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "This skill is acting like you are dead! '"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "No No, it is more than acting, you "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "actually look dead!!! .."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "The name of the skill is ^3355FF' Play Dead '^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "It is a skill I used as a novice."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "But don't think little of it because"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "it is a novice skill. In fact, it takes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "extreme concentration and skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "to even make this skill pass as believable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "For example,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "What if you are attacked by a strong"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "monster and can't survive."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "You must play dead!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "But if the monster was to tickle you,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "could you control yourself?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "The skill will help you deal with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "many situations such as this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "It is truly a skill for the strong minded."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "The goal of the skill is to look"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "perfectly dead. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I think that's enough explanation."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I can tell by the look in your eyes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "that you are ready for your training."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Lets not delay!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Ok, take this pill first. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Let's see how this goes. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Within in 10 minutes, you must"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "go to the 2nd floor of the Prontera Castle's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "East wing. ^3355FF' Newbie Tag '^000000 is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "the item you are seeking. ! . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "^3355FF- *Gulp* (You have swallowed the pill) -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "The pill that you have just taken"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "will make it difficult for you to breathe. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Kekekk . .AH HA - Just joking !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "It is actually a pill to gives you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "a mental calm so you can be patient."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I think that nothing is better"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "training than running."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Okay? GO! ! ! ! ~~~~~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If you are late, you have to do it again! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Now GO ! GO ! GO !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Run ~~~~~!!!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "HEY! what are you doing here ? !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "You must be very irresponsible to be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "here when your time is running out."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Run Run Run! - - - - -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "On the 2nd floor of the east wing!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "It's in the Prontera castle!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Okayyyyy~~~!! *waves goodbye*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Hey... I see that you have -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "finished your quest! ! ! . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If you can endure all this,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "it shouldn't be a problem to use"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "this skill. You are a natural!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Now, if you ever feel threatened,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "use this skill as you see fit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : " ' Play Dead ' "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Okay okay, See you around ! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "What? -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Why haven't you finished your quest?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : " *Tsk* *Tsk* You must have lost the pass . . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Such irresponsibility is not acceptable."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I can't accept you into training until"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I know you are capable. Go and try again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Don't take me lightly. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If I tell you to come in 10 minutes,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I expect that of you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "In order for you to have another chance,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "you must start from the beginning. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Do it right this time ! ! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Yeah... I remember back to long ago !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Especially those embarrassing Novice years."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Wow... It is funny to think about those years now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Those years were difficult. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Thankfully you can use the First Aid"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "skill when you reach novice job level 7."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "That saved me many times in the past. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "I am sure it will help you much as well."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "Hopefully, it will be something you use well . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "[Bulma]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If you have any friends who are novices,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "tell them about me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "If I can, I will help them out"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Chivalry Member",
      "text" : "as best as I can . . . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "[Dread Lord]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : ". . . . . . . . . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : ". . . . . . . . . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Stop pestering me! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "I am very busy ! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Would you just bug off ? ! ? !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "[Dread Lord]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "The people who work here at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Prontera clinic are battling life"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "and death everyday."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "It takes a lot of patience and "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "puts a lot of tension on us."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Sorry if we seem a bit uptight. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 379,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "[Dread Lord]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 380,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "I am the Nursing director."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "There are many things I must do."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 382,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "If your business is complete, please leave."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "[Dread Lord]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Ohhh . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "You have come here for bandages ?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Do you even know how we get these"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "precious bandages ?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "They come from a powerful monster"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "that is found in the pyramids of Morocc."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "[Dread Lord]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "The monster is some sort of mummy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "We take the rotten bandages from it's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "diseased body and sanitize them. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Do you believe me ? . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Nursing Instructor",
      "text" : "Heh heh... There is even poison"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
